        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\frac12$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt e}&=\\ln e^{-\\frac12}\\\\\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt e}&=-\\frac12\\ln e\\\\\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt e}&=-\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
