          "short": "$-\\frac32$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt{e^3}}&=\\ln e^{-\\frac32}\\\\\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt{e^3}}&=-\\frac32\\ln e\\\\\\ln\\frac1{\\sqrt{e^3}}&=-\\frac32\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
